        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face an unrelenting onslaught of savage creatures in this adrenaline-fueled 2D top-down arcade-shooter where every second is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is to master a vast and devastating arsenal of weapons, from blistering-fast machine guns to screen-clearing explosives, as you carve a path of destruction across the 8 intricately detailed maps the world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a battle; it's a journey of growth. You'll level up your survivor through a deep and unique class and perk system, fine-tuning your abilities to become the ultimate monster-slaying force and constantly shattering your previous high scores as your power grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to face the nightmare alone; endure the peril as a solitary hero, or form a squad with up to 3 other friends and watch each other's backs in a glorious symphony of cooperative chaos</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face an unrelenting onslaught of savage creatures in this adrenaline-fueled 2D top-down arcade-shooter where every second is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is to master a vast and devastating arsenal of weapons, from blistering-fast machine guns to screen-clearing explosives, as you carve a path of destruction across the 8 intricately detailed maps the world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a battle; it's a journey of growth. You'll level up your survivor through a deep and unique class and perk system, fine-tuning your abilities to become the ultimate monster-slaying force and constantly shattering your previous high scores as your power grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to face the nightmare alone; endure the peril as a solitary hero, or form a squad with up to 3 other friends and watch each other's backs in a glorious symphony of cooperative chaos</p>",
        "short_description": "Battle against hordes of violent creatures in this 2D arcade-shooter. Utilize your vast arsenal of weapons to survive across the 8 maps, level up using the unique class and perk system, beat your previous high scores as you become stronger. Endure the peril alone, or with up to 3 other friends.",
